// VIEWMODEL CONTRACT v1 (UI01 Final Contract v1)
type PublicJson=string|number|boolean|null|PublicJson[]|{[key:string]:PublicJson};
type RiskPresentation={level:'safe'|'guarded'|'dangerous'|'unknown';labelKey:string;detailKey?:string};
type PublicCause={publicId:string;level:'explicit'|'hinted';titleKey?:string;summaryKey:string};
export type PublicState={schemaVersion:number;rulesVersion:string;contentVersion:string;stateVersion:number;runId:string;pageState:PageState;runStatus:'offered'|'active'|'dying'|'ended'|'abandoned';publicRun:Record<string,PublicJson>;capabilities:Record<string,boolean>;publicCauses:PublicCause[]};
export type CurrentInteraction={interactionId:string;kind:'destinyOffer'|'event'|'specialNode'|'ending'|'rebirth';titleKey:string;body:PublicJson;options:Array<{optionId:string;labelKey:string;riskPresentation?:RiskPresentation}>;interactionState:'idle'|'submitting'|'confirmed'|'retryableError'|'fatalError';retryCommandId?:string};
export type PublicHistory={entries:Array<{entryId:string;kind:string;titleKey:string;summaryKey:string;data?:Record<string,PublicJson>}>};
export type ShareViewModel={title:string;summary:string;imageKey?:string;facts:Array<{label:string;value:string}>};
The client receives only a public projection the player is entitled to know.
Never send in client business ViewModel: rootSeed; RNG internal state; drawIndex; hidden Causes; Cause salience; echoBudget; Cause eligibility; selector weights; futureEventIds; NPC hidden state; undisclosed NPC death/missing status; complete CheckSpec; difficulty; EffectSpec; internal trace; anti-cheat/security fields.
Hidden Causes are omitted, not represented by placeholders, counts or inferable metadata.
commandId is not a server secret. Application/Transport may create, hold, persist and reuse it for idempotent retry. It is not shown to the player.
riskPresentation is produced by a server-controlled ViewModel Builder. Client renders it and never derives risk from difficulty, RNG, hidden state or CheckSpec.
ViewModel may only project/filter/format/aggregate/translate authoritative results. It must not roll RNG, decide Outcome, advance time, create Cause, mutate RuleState, or decide breakthrough results.
ShareViewModel contains public share-safe data only and cannot be converted into rule effects.
